The '''Burnsi Run''' was a [[hyperspace route]] that led in the direction of the [[planet]] [[Midarr]]. On the planet [[Dol'har Hyde]]&mdash;while investigating the site where a [[Nihil]] [[Path engine]] was found and sold to [[Beol De'Rruyet]] of [[De'Rruyet Industries]], who planned to unveil the technology at an expo on Midarr&mdash;the rogue [[archaeologist]] [[Doctor]] [[Chelli Lona Aphra|Chelli Aphra]] suggested taking the Burnsi Run to the [[smuggler]] [[Sana Starros]]. Starros, however, insisted that she had no interest in accompanying Aphra to Midarr.<ref name="Aphra 8" />

